OL,3,GNEWSAFamily hit #1m target for son with
OL,4,Aultra-rare MND
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family have raised #1m for specialist
OL,7,Ftreatment for their six-year-old son,
OL,8,Fwho is believed to be the youngest
OL,9,Fperson in the UK living with an
OL,10,Fextremely rare form of Juvenile ALS.
OL,12,FPartaap's parents launched the appeal
OL,13,Fafter he was diagnosed with a rare
OL,14,Fvariant of the condition, a form of
OL,15,Fmotor neurone disease, earlier this
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FThe family said they reached their #1m
OL,19,Ftarget in just over two weeks, with
OL,20,Fdonations coming from their local
OL,21,Fcommunity and supporters around the
OL,22,Fworld.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
